  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\because$ no. of triangles having no side common with a $\\mathrm{n}$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { sided polygon }=\\frac{{ }^n C_1 \\cdot{ }^{n-4} C_2}{3} \\\\\n& =\\frac{{ }^8 C_1 \\cdot{ }^4 C_2}{3}=16\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
